


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_6eaab4bd:



    voice "2HI_0466"
    hina "「快看快看。下雪啦！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_26e2b38f:


    "阳菜隔着窗户看到雪兴奋了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_62965aa9:


    "因为与外面的温差，窗户上很快就起了一层雾，每次起雾她就浇上点热水，望着白雪飞舞。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_50b02077:



    voice "2FU_0427"
    fumi "「赏雪泡澡，不错呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_7bfb2889:



    voice "2MI_0333"
    miyako "「一边泡在澡盆里一边赏雪，感觉真是太奢侈了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_504fa7a7:


    "像在被炉里吃冰激凌一样呢。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_ce4fea54:



    voice "2HI_0467"
    hina "「有点像是露天温泉呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_77f958c0:



    voice "2RI_0496"
    rin "「哈。今年冬天已经下了好几场雪了吧？从窗户望过去也只是内庭而已。已经看过了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a931e986:



    voice "2HI_0468"
    hina "「哈。真没情调呢。场景不同就不一样了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_19825c22:



    voice "2RI_0497"
    rin "「只要不为了借浴室去旁边宿舍就好。我曾经遇难过」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_fd3dbaac:



    voice "2HI_0469"
    hina "「太夸张了吧。你那是什么山坳坳里的秘密澡堂啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_22e679dc:



    voice "2FU_0428"
    fumi "「哈哈哈，大家像这样热热闹闹地泡澡真是不错呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_8e1092e8:



    voice "2HI_0470"
    hina "「嗯嗯，宽敞的澡堂真好，叫人放松。施工前的太小了，而且还太破了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_f159b952:


    "施工之前的澡堂最多一次容纳两个人。澡盆只能容纳一个人。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_0bfb9e75:


    "施行的是一个人在泡澡的时候，另一个人去洗身体和头发的换班制。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_4d95e826:



    voice "2RI_0498"
    rin "「除了澡堂子，还有很多地方希望修一修啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_1514ac4a:



    voice "2FU_0429"
    fumi "「毕竟这里是圣叶宿舍里最古老的建筑物呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_30f9cf7a:



    voice "2RI_0499"
    rin "「重新建一栋不是更快吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_57b548a9:



    voice "2FU_0430"
    fumi "「顺便一说祥子姐似乎已经在这里做宿管5年了哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_01131ec2:



    voice "2RI_0500"
    rin "「多大了，那个人？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_100a613f:



    voice "2MI_0334"
    miyako "「多大了呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_13ad01fa:



    voice "2RI_0501"
    rin "「明明是她的堂妹？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_ae8f6292:


    "天使对于年龄的感觉很淡薄，不清楚自己已经申报了多少年税金，或者在人间活了多少年。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_cd3f1928:



    voice "2MI_0335"
    miyako "「啊，生日是在圣诞节」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_399449a6:



    voice "2FU_0431"
    fumi "「啊，真的吗！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_4b7fb7bb:



    voice "2HI_0471"
    hina "「为什么不说一声呢。知道的话就帮她庆祝了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_4816e3d2:



    voice "2RI_0502"
    rin "「圣夜夜呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_7722234b:



    voice "2MI_0336"
    miyako "「啊，我也是在圣诞节」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_20aa7d09:



    voice "2HI_0472"
    hina "「为什么不说一声呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_06d11668:



    voice "2RI_0503"
    rin "「明年就可以三个人一起庆祝了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_72a495e3:



    voice "2HI_0473"
    hina "「我的差了5天！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a039f648:


    "生气了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_5158be7f:



    voice "2MI_0337"
    miyako "「呀？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_7c8259de:


    "圣夜子发出了悲鸣声。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_b47e133b:



    voice "2HI_0474"
    hina "「怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_809db3df:



    voice "2MI_0338"
    miyako "「那个，脚碰到了什么」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_f1c3abfc:



    voice "2FU_0432"
    fumi "「是小鸭子哟」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_2280805b:


    "澡盆上飘着玩具小鸭。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_877f94ab:



    voice "2MI_0339"
    miyako "「这是什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_90e48590:


    "圣夜子戳了戳小鸭的脑袋。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_80bec297:



    voice "2HI_0475"
    hina "「是祥子姐的恶作剧吧。啊，我已经检查过没有隐蔽摄像机了，你们可以放心了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_3fae1035:



    voice "2MI_0340"
    miyako "「哈啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_bb566ccf:


    "圣夜子一放开手，小鸭就慢悠悠地漂走了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_7e1b3f6a:



    voice "2RI_0504"
    rin "「话说啊，别管什么窗外面的雪景了，享受下眼前的绝景吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_dea4a1e4:


    "说着，伦用毛巾擦掉眼镜上的雾气，然后双眼放出了光来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_cc08b12d:



    voice "2RI_0505"
    rin "「学校里屈指可数的两位美少女的全身裸体。简直就是视觉上的极致享受。我是女孩子真是太好了，是室友真是太好了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_de54774b:



    voice "2HI_0476"
    hina "「喂，别用色色的目光看你的室友！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_4b1d3d81:



    voice "2RI_0506"
    rin "「你以为我是为什么把眼镜带进来的——啊，快一边去，色色的小鸟」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_2c3400b2:


    "小鸭不知何时漂了过来撞到了伦的胸口，伦正在用热水把它泼走。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_7d9778da:



    voice "2HI_0477"
    hina "「色色的人是你！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_988ee0f0:



    voice "2RI_0507"
    rin "「胸部啊，胸部啊，跳过，胸部啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_ad65a73c:



    voice "2HI_0478"
    hina "「喂！伦你不也没那么大吗！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_e31aa87e:



    voice "2RI_0508"
    rin "「爆乳，巨乳，跳过，美乳」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a02053d6:



    voice "2HI_0479"
    hina "「你丫的——！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_6cbba344:



    voice "2MI_0341"
    miyako "「文同学，这种时候我应该露出什么表情呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a54b9993:



    voice "2FU_0433"
    fumi "「啊哈哈……应该露出什么表情呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a_f14fd2e8:



    voice "2HI_0480"
    hina "「不许看小文！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a_9cf84744:


    "阳菜向伦哗啦哗啦地泼热水。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a_a87974c7:



    voice "2RI_0509"
    rin "「呜呜呜呜。怎么了啦小气鬼——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a_5e54ec7e:



    voice "2HI_0481"
    hina "「这可不是小气的问题！是小文会讨厌吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a_4d9d6a61:



    voice "2RI_0510"
    rin "「啊，浅生你不喜欢吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a_f6d6d265:



    voice "2FU_0434"
    fumi "「那个……有点不好意思呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a_010de66c:



    voice "2RI_0511"
    rin "「居然只是有点害羞」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a_3589a8a9:



    voice "2HI_0482"
    hina "「那就是在说不喜欢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a_488930e3:



    voice "2RI_0512"
    rin "「那个胸部，又不是阳菜的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a_4ed5dec1:



    voice "2HI_0483"
    hina "「是我的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a_3a7dee73:



    voice "2MI_0342"
    miyako "「噢噢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a_a7ca612d:



    voice "2RI_0513"
    rin "「就看了一下，又不会让浅生的胸部少一块啦～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a_f228597c:



    voice "2HI_0484"
    hina "「小文，我可以打她吗！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_a_ab173f9c:



    voice "2FU_0435"
    fumi "「啊哈哈……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_b_27f5ac33:



    voice "2RI_0514"
    rin "「我舔～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_b_6857a0b7:


    "伦趁闹起来的阳菜不注意，摸了把她的屁股。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_b_637e4a37:



    voice "2HI_0485"
    hina "「啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_b_f95189e5:


    "伴随着可爱的悲鸣，阳菜跳了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_b_088397df:



    voice "2RI_0515"
    rin "「嗯，屁股是阳菜的最小最可爱啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_b_baa0691d:


    "这孩子，有时候会若无其事地说出这种话来呢。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_b_fef74ed3:



    voice "2HI_0486"
    hina "「你，你，你别在别人面前做这种事儿！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_b_ce5332ab:


    "虽然嘴上这么说，但明显已经没了脾气，露出了少女般的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_b_f589c1c5:



    voice "2RI_0516RE"
    rin "「不在别人面前就可以吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_b_acdf29d9:



    voice "2HI_0487"
    hina "「如，如果伦想的话……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_b_0f8d38a6:


    "阳菜红着脸低下了头。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_b_0320c1da:



    voice "2MI_0343"
    miyako "「噢噢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_b_71a4f3f8:



    voice "2FU_0436"
    fumi "「哇哇哇，不行不行太色情了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_7f721821:



    voice "2RI_0517"
    rin "「隔着水汽的文也很是色气呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_d0c4d69e:


    "伦说着抬了抬眼镜。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_f1f86e96:



    voice "2FU_0437"
    fumi "「那个，你这么直勾勾地盯着我看，确实是有点让人害羞」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_ef852f09:



    voice "2RI_0518"
    rin "「不也挺好的吗，不也挺好的吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_e2a0b64f:


    "不会不好意思的伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_6c6fa901:



    voice "2FU_0438"
    fumi "「啊，喂！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_6b4791d9:


    "在澡盆里伸出腿的话脚尖就会碰到文的大腿。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_7797d2d7:



    voice "2FU_0439"
    fumi "「该来一点惩罚了，嘿」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_c1677972:



    voice "2RI_0519"
    rin "「呜哇！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_736b0c93:


    "文啪地一下抓住伦的脚脖子，紧紧地按着脚上的穴位。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_62260447:



    voice "2RI_0520"
    rin "「啊！好疼好疼！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_9133192e:



    voice "2HI_0488"
    hina "「抖M不是会因为疼而高兴么，所以这不是不算惩罚吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_ad3d3341:



    voice "2RI_0521"
    rin "「不！那个！这个！不是那种疼！并不是什么样的痛感都行的——！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_636f870a:



    voice "2MI_0344"
    miyako "「原来如此～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_470e4cbc:



    voice "2HI_0489"
    hina "「啊哈哈，受罚吧你」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_c5e38c4d:



    voice "2RI_0522"
    rin "「请原谅我！对不起对不起对不——！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_c_8269325a:



    voice "2FU_0440"
    fumi "「怎么办好呢～♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_3173cf96:



    voice "2HI_0490"
    hina "「圣夜子，后背……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_9dc7a567:



    voice "2MI_0345"
    miyako "「咦，我的后背怎么了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_6db69efe:


    "听到阳菜的声音，正准备离开澡盆的圣夜子回过头。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_e9e7d83d:



    voice "2HI_0491"
    hina "「好像有个痣」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_2ea5d123:



    voice "2MI_0346"
    miyako "「痣……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_12710e5b:


    "圣夜子一脸不可思议地越过肩膀看着自己的后背。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_b13f71f6:



    voice "2RI_0523"
    rin "「喂，圣夜夜可能会在意的。要体贴」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_4f56cf60:


    "伦戳了戳阳菜的腰。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_cbb01461:



    voice "2HI_0492"
    hina "「啊，抱歉！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_62c2bbec:



    voice "2MI_0347"
    miyako "「不。那个，没关系的。因为我自己都不知道」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_f6987db3:



    voice "2FU_0441"
    fumi "「只是很浅的一块哦。可能会被看成是肩胛骨的影子」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_792b7f2a:



    voice "2MI_0348"
    miyako "「是，是吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_0cb5b4ba:



    voice "2HI_0493"
    hina "「我还以为是翅膀的痕迹」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_d6974319:



    voice "2MI_0349"
    miyako "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_8e849486:


    "这个女孩果然很敏锐。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_94bde224:


    "那是真正的翅膀的痕迹。背上的痣是原本身为天使的证明。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_5ae129e3:



    voice "2MI_0350"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_145ed9f5:



    voice "2RI_0524"
    rin "「话说阳菜的屁股上还有蒙古斑啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_c81fec62:



    voice "2HI_0494"
    hina "「啊，不是吧！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_d_487b59ca:


    "阳菜慌慌张张地回头看自己的屁股。"




translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_ed2f32ac:


    voice "2RI_0505"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_05_dc0e65b7:


    rin "「校园里屈指可数的两位美少女的全身裸体。简直就是视觉上的极致享受。我是女孩子真是太好了，是室友真是太好了」"
